From 187bb3b61e764f1b8250642135472b6005305c79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 01:22:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] borg: zap a Rod of Teleport Other in the Teleport Other
 defence

The defence that teleports a dangerous monster away accepted the
Teleport Other spell, an item activation or a charged Wand of Teleport
Other, but not a Rod of Teleport Other. A Borg without the spell that
carried only the rod never considered teleporting the monster away: a
wounded Warrior next to a hill giant kept meleeing it instead.

Accept a charged rod the Borg can zap (borg_equips_rod applies the same
device-skill check used for other rods), and zap it when the defence is
chosen, after the spell, activation and wand. The target key that
follows is the same.

Tracked as diegoami/neo-angband-tracker#549.

(cherry picked from commit d4071b06e2d298a17e1a55559daceccf9663f9f3)
---
 src/borg/borg-fight-defend.c | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-fight-defend.c b/src/borg/borg-fight-defend.c
index 6945ec261..191549288 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-fight-defend.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-fight-defend.c
@@ -1156,7 +1156,8 @@ static int borg_defend_aux_tele_away(int p1)
     if (borg_spell_okay_fail(TELEPORT_OTHER, fail_allowed)
         || borg_equips_item(act_tele_other, true)
         || (-1 != borg_slot(TV_WAND, sv_wand_teleport_away)
-            && borg_items[borg_slot(TV_WAND, sv_wand_teleport_away)].pval))
+            && borg_items[borg_slot(TV_WAND, sv_wand_teleport_away)].pval)
+        || borg_equips_rod(sv_rod_teleport_other))
         spell_ok = true;
 
     if (!spell_ok)
@@ -1270,7 +1271,8 @@ static int borg_defend_aux_tele_away(int p1)
 
     /* Cast the spell */
     if (borg_spell(TELEPORT_OTHER) || borg_activate_item(act_tele_other)
-        || borg_aim_wand(sv_wand_teleport_away)) {
+        || borg_aim_wand(sv_wand_teleport_away)
+        || borg_zap_rod(sv_rod_teleport_other)) {
         /* Use target */
         borg_keypress('5');
 
